---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Results">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 tracking-wide uppercase eyebrow mb-2">Case studies</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl mb-8">
      Creativity that delivers, time and time again
    </h1>
    <p class="lede text-xl text-slate-600 mb-16 max-w-3xl">
      I've delivered results for all kinds of clients, from a global entertainment giant to a data-driven finance platform.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-16">
      <!-- Sports -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Sports</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="text-lg text-slate-700 space-y-4">
            <p class="desc">As global lead copywriter at LIV Golf, I have played a foundational role in the world's most disruptive sports project.</p>
            <p class="desc">My role has spanned everything from brand architecture to event signage, helping establish the league in over 20 different countries.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-indigo-50 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
            <p class="case-caption font-semibold text-indigo-900 text-center">LIV attracted more than 4 million paying guests and 240 million website views during my time on the project.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Business and finance -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Business and finance</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="text-lg text-slate-700 space-y-4">
            <p class="desc">I have produced a range of thought-leadership content for business and financial brands, channelling my journalistic background to provide original insights.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-indigo-50 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
            <p class="case-caption font-semibold text-indigo-900 text-center">This daily newsletter for Stockopedia achieves an average open rate of over 15%.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Healthcare -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Healthcare</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="text-lg text-slate-700 space-y-4">
            <p class="desc">In tandem with The Keenfolks, a digital transformation agency in Barcelona, I led the creation of Protect Our Future Too — a global campaign to protect domestic animals from the effects of climate change.</p>
            <p class="desc">Our collaboration led to effective interactions at every touchpoint.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-indigo-50 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
            <p class="case-caption font-semibold text-indigo-900 text-center">The campaign reached its apex in an international conference attended by delegates from 19 countries.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- AI and machine learning -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">AI and machine learning</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="text-lg text-slate-700 space-y-4">
            <p class="desc">Before Claude. Before Gemini. Even before ChatGPT, I was covering AI as both a journalist and copywriter, building the knowledge which means I can communicate this topic with native fluency.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-indigo-50 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
            <p class="case-caption font-semibold text-indigo-900 text-center">At LIV Golf we worked with London-based product agency Future Platforms to develop Fan Caddie, the first chatbot for golf fans.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-16 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Want results like these for your brand?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Tell me what you're trying to achieve on a free discovery call, and I'll show you exactly how I'd approach it.</p>
      <a href="mailto:contact@invincibleink.com" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 border border-transparent rounded-md shadow-sm text-base font-medium text-slate-900 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100">
        Let's talk results
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
